      "version_introduced": "1.2.0",
      "status": "ACTIVE",
      "normative_text": "Developer outputs must not contain self-review, self-approval, merge claims, closeout claims, or next-phase starts. Delivery state for anything post-delivery is reported as LIVE_GITHUB_REQUIRED, never asserted from repository text or memory.",
